    {
      "id": "tbb-requires-0bbcb7",
      "name": "__TBB_requires",
      "category": "parallel_scan",
      "signature": "__TBB_requires(Body)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Body",
          "type": "tbb_range<Range>&& parallel_scan_body<Body,Range> ) void parallel_scan ( Range& range,Body&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "template<Range,Body>",
      "docs": "\\page parallel_scan_body_req Requirements on parallel_scan body\nClass \\c Body implementing the concept of parallel_scan body must define:\n- \\code Body::Body( Body&, split ); \\endcode    Splitting constructor.\nSplit \\c b so that \\c this and \\c b can accumulate separately\n- \\code Body::~Body(); \\endcode                 Destructor\n- \\code void Body::operator()( const Range& r, pre_scan_tag ); \\endcode\nPreprocess iterations for range \\c r\n- \\code void Body::operator()( const Range& r, final_scan_tag ); \\endcode\nDo final processing for iterations of range \\c r\n- \\code void Body::reverse_join( Body& a ); \\endcode\nMerge preprocessing state of \\c a into \\c this, where \\c a was\ncreated earlier from \\c b by b's splitting constructor"
    },
